  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadow of the Luchador buildings, Scabz grew up scavenging for scraps and fighting for every drop of DRIP. He learned to wrench apart machines for parts and lives by a code of the streets, sharpened by the constant threat of toxic runoff and rival flocks.",
    "class": "Mechanic Brawler",
    "name": "Scabz",
    "personality": "Wary and resourceful, Scabz trusts no one but himself and his (sometimes unreliable) tech. He's got a dry wit and a knack for finding the humor in the grim reality of Subchain City, but underneath it all, he's fiercely loyal to his chosen flock, if they can earn it. The AI eyes give him an uncanny ability to see weaknesses in both machines and other ducks, making him a valuable asset in raids.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Toxic Wrench: Scabz can use his cranker to infuse a melee attack with toxic residue, dealing poison damage over time and weakening the target's armor. Works best on mechanical opponents. This ability is particularly effective in close quarters.",
      "name": "Toxic Wrench"
